    <comment>Update python-caio to 0.10.1 (new io_uring backend, undefined-symbol build fixes, Apache-2.0 metadata); Source switched to the GitHub tag (0.10.x not on PyPI) with fix-version-info.patch for the stale version.py. Now also runs the upstream pytest suite in %check (excluding the aiomisc-dependent and chroot-writable-dir tests). Build + tests green across py311/313/314, rpmlint clean.</comment>
